#: includes/arrays.php
msgid ""
"Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr ""
"Ett fel uppstod när överföringsläget skulle ställas in på binärt läge eller "
"ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Den begärda SSL-nivån för FTP kunde inte användas."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid ""
"The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server "
"is sane."
msgstr ""
"FTP-kommandot REST returnerade ett fel. Det bör inte hända om servern "
"fungerar som den ska."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid ""
"FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl "
"fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr ""
"FTP-servrar returnerar en 227-rad som svar på ett PASV-kommando. Om libcurl "
"inte kan tolka raden returneras den här felkoden."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid ""
"During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the "
"CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr ""
"Tidsgränsen CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (eller den interna standardtidsgränsen)"
" överskreds under väntan på serverns anslutning i en aktiv FTP-session."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid ""
"Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response "
"to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr ""
"libcurl fick inget begripligt svar från servern på kommandot PASV eller "
"EPSV. Servern fungerar inte korrekt."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed string found"
msgstr "Felsträng hittades"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed string not found"
msgstr "Felsträng hittades inte"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maint string found"
msgstr "Underhållssträng hittades"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Form urlencoded"
msgstr "Formulärkodade data"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "POST method, form-urlencoded"
msgstr "POST-metod, formulärkodade data"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP download file, default port 22"
msgstr "SCP – hämta fil, standardport 22"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SMB encrypted (SMBS) download file, default port 445"
msgstr "Krypterad SMB (SMBS) – hämta fil, standardport 445"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SMB plaintext download file, default port 445"
msgstr "Okrypterad SMB – hämta fil, standardport 445"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No data"
msgstr "Inga data"
